Server init.
>> a := Blob አዲስ: 4.
a bytes: ( ሰልፍ አዲስ ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob አዲስ: 4.
b bytes: ( ሰልፍ አዲስ ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a አዲስ.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
ውጤት ፃፍ: ['xorred:'], አዲስ-መስመር. 
ውጤት ፃፍ: n, አዲስ-መስመር. 
} ያዝ: { :e ውጤት ፃፍ: e, አዲስ-መስመር. }, ጀምር.
a ልቀቅ.
b ልቀቅ.
